  "notes": "Three experiments across 10 sites in northern Laos during 2007 wet season. Exp 1 (HK1, LO1): split-split-plot, 4 reps, biochar 0/4/8/16 t/ha x N 0/50 kg/ha x 2 cultivars. Exp 2 (7 sites): RCBD, 3 reps, biochar 0/8 t/ha only, Apo only. Exp 3 (HK4): split-plot, 3 reps, biochar 0/8 t/ha x N/P/NP fertilizer - data in Figure 1 only (estimated ~0.8 vs 1.0 t/ha for no fert, ~1.2 vs 1.5 for NP). LO1 data excluded due to severe lodging. Biochar from wood residues (teak, rosewood), earth mound method. CA improved yield at low-P sites (LO2, HK3 significant at p<0.05) but reduced yield at high-P sites."
}